ASS]/[FAIL]` + summary `ALL PASS`/`HAS FAILURES`; exit code 0/1 177	- **Error handling**: FAIL = protocol unmet; fix per detail and rerun (e.g., "propose round without evaluation: R01" → add log-evaluate entries); `missing log.jsonl` → protocol execution must have logs 178	 179	## calc-energy — contract-caliber energy density (same formula for all tasks) 180	 181	``` 182	bda calc-energy --sim S [--params P] [--base B] --out O 183	``` 184	 185	- **Formula (contract caliber, preventing cross-task precedent copying)**: `ED = ∫V·I_1C dt / Σ(layer thickness×(1−porosity)×density×area)` 186	  - Discharge energy = trapezoidal integral of `voltage_v`×`time_s` × I_1C, ÷3600 for Wh; I_1C = `Nominal cell capacity [A.h]` × 1 (constant current) 187	  - Area = `Electrode height [m]` × `Electrode width [m]` 188	  - Layers: positive/negative active layers (porosity factor applied), positive/negative current collectors (no porosity factor), separator — all from the parameter set used by `--base` (default Chen2020) or overridden by `--params` 189	  - **Electrolyte excluded from mass** (parameter set lacks density) — output `electrolyte_included: false` annotated honestly 190	- **Input**: `--sim` = discharge simulation output JSON (must contain `voltage_v` list, `time_s` list, `capacity_ah` scalar); `--params` optional, overrides the parameter set (the same params file used by run-pyamm) 191	- **Output**: `{capacity_ah, energy_wh, mass_kg, energy_density_wh_kg, volume_m3, energy_density_wh_l, thickness_m, midpoint_voltage_v, dcr_ohm, power_density_w_kg, layer_kg_m2 (per layer kg/m²), area_m2, electrolyte_included: false, note}` 192	  - `energy_density_wh_l` = energy/volume (volume = Σ layer thickness×area; contract caliber excludes electrolyte/casing) 193	  - `midpoint_voltage_v` = voltage at discharge-time midpoint (plateau-voltage approximation); `dcr_ohm` = DC resistance (start OCV − voltage at 10% discharge ÷ I_1C); `power_density_w_kg` = V_OC²/(4·DCR) ÷ mass 194	  - Judgment and r